    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>百年船与绿花调</span></p><p><strong><span>大佛之香第四季《柴园往事》</span></strong></p><p><span>三代女性——外婆柴荔、母亲柴娜、女儿柴青。</span></p><p><span>百年船木厚重沧桑</span></p><p><span>一如这木材生意的家族底色。</span></p><p><span>外婆从外公手中接过生意，从内宅走向厅堂。</span></p><p><span>母亲执掌生意赚足黄白二物，却始终难觅真心。</span></p><p><span>后来，柴青读了书，柴园生意没落，她的爱慕也沉入深海。</span></p><p><span>家族羁绊与时代洪流如潮水拍打船舷，打湿衣衫也刻下印记。</span></p><p><span>三支香叠喷有一脉相承的风骨和相互作用力，很美妙。</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv6DkxBH7TAw5IAGU41Wjbc6qv9U.jpg"></figure><p><span>大佛和朋友的播客：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65a6b1beec3538f0d2b54008" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65a6b1beec3538f0d2b54008"><span>液态电波</span></a></p><p></p><p><span>和克克的另两档播客： </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/640190a6269dda892943257f" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/640190a6269dda892943257f"><span>直角不垂直</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/69247e858fc16df4c35a5939" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/69247e858fc16df4c35a5939"><span>《无名入口》</span></a></p><p><span>联络方式：</span></p><p><span>入群请加：</span></p><p><span>Perfumekai2023或Kaikaixiaohuoche</span></p><p><span>暗号“百无禁忌”</span></p><p><span>商务请加：carolemomo</span></p><p><span>微博：开小火车去钟情殿</span></p><p><span>小红书：开小火车</span></p><p><span>苹果播客：开小火车</span></p><p><span>艾瑞克小红：</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/2XVUmoWlDrb" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/2XVUmoWlDrb"><span>518919970</span></a></p><p><span>开小火车小红：</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/6wcxcZYTkvx" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/6wcxcZYTkvx"><span>679441639</span></a></p>]]></description>
