    <title>102｜Pape Moe✖️阿花「芭乐栀子花」</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a7ac18236641f136d86719c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a7ac18236641f136d86719c</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 07:26:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“Leng说做个芭乐，</span></p><p><span>Jasmine说加点栀子花，</span></p><p><span>阿花说再来点姜。</span></p><p><span>可能是全中国最喜欢香水的三个人，</span></p><p><span>一起完成了这样一只热带果香。</span></p><p></p><p><span>Pape Moe的热带叙事这次来到了中国广州，</span></p><p><span>热带从不是遥远的国度，它离我们很近。</span></p><p><span>我们创作了一只亚热带夏季晚风的气味。</span></p><p><span>晚风徐徐，果香盈盈，花瓣闪闪。”</span></p><p><span>———— 摘自 Pape Moe</span></p><p><span>「芭乐栀子花」是饱含童年记忆的/乘着晚风的/让我“三倍惊喜”的一只香。</span></p><p><span>更多Pape Moe的热带香水节目请移步播客88期及99期。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr5GNw-MLk2qOjVL9U7wJlePlA_3.jpg"><p></p><p><span>和克克的另两档播客： </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/640190a6269dda892943257f" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/640190a6269dda892943257f"><span>直角不垂直</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/69247e858fc16df4c35a5939" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/69247e858fc16df4c35a5939"><span>《无名入口》</span></a></p><p><span>联络方式：</span></p><p><span>入群请加：</span></p><p><span>Perfumekai2023或Kaikaixiaohuoche</span></p><p><span>暗号“百无禁忌”</span></p><p><span>商务请加：carolemomo</span></p><p><span>微博：开小火车去钟情殿</span></p><p><span>小红书：开小火车</span></p><p><span>苹果播客：开小火车</span></p><p><span>艾瑞克小红：</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/2XVUmoWlDrb" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/2XVUmoWlDrb"><span>518919970</span></a></p><p><span>开小火车小红：</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/6wcxcZYTkvx" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/6wcxcZYTkvx"><span>679441639</span></a></p>]]></description>
